osigns a typed six-member projection, never the JSON object as received, so a verifier must reconstruct the cosigned object from those six members and no others. That the same rule holds where `raw` is absent is what makes the exclusion checkable: every other cosigned vector in this corpus shares this preimage construction.","type":"statement-anchored"},"claim_material":{},"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.4","inputs":[{"dataset":"customers","record":"hmac-sha256:31bfb2a84c511407fe867673d0fba30a87615dc78a0d6ef6041f8aa598cabde9","role":"feature","statement":"sha256:407c9b57bea3d539e8828b46b7b784a7b23993d0785e466c71bbd5583fd40bb3"},{"dataset":"customers","record":"hmac-sha256:4f561671377c6cb318881c5abda7ced5db0c59ae40b482e50c8402b8892617ad","role":"reference","statement":"sha256:6364904bd589c3418d8dfa88b0f693dc5b4b28587a4a1951f4a86f1fb2b09215"}],"issued_at":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","manifest":"sha256:83699af288980b1e8dd8909fec8e685ed27fa7165f820d276ebfe41591c44975","outputs":[{"dataset":"scores","locator":"urn:ahl-test:scores/S1","record":"sha256:6824fd2fddfc88cea7320793e819912f630e21d6936d7a1a0c056779c715b1f3"}],"pipeline":"scoring-v1","producer":"producer-1","transform":{"code":{"digest":"sha256:6020efb5f77f23aeb11dd4a99623e6fdd09bb16167cb04d51e41614661a57305","type":"git_commit"},"model":{"digest":"sha256:4010a9f46dbc15f9525f0e43bd55b2498b85a667e59e783270dca2ae97c62dfa","version":"risk-v4.2"},"params":{"digest":"sha256:82328ce226d48bfd85b70be5918fdc3cd9759478a2e0c107925ac997bbf18a1e"}},"type":"derivation","valid_time":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z"},"signatures":[{"key_id":"sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e","sig":"base64:N2NsDBHThIRIFg+jZ2D4WJN9PNcmwEz4q4ngG7lHC0RlhW4SUraAYZwQfZ2HrQ/jrWpEQqRPColaXoS/GaCcDw=="}]},"governance":{"chain":[{"entry_index":0,"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.4","datasets":{"customers":{"authority":{"key_ids":["sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e"],"producer":"pro